OL,3,AWhat we know about deadly Nepal-Tibet
OL,4,Afloods
OL,5,
OL,6,FMassive landslides and flash floods on
OL,7,Fthe Nepal-Tibet border have caused
OL,8,Fwidespread damage and left hundreds
OL,9,Fdead or missing.
OL,11,FSearch and rescue operations are
OL,12,Fcontinuing after Wednesday's disaster.
OL,13,FChinese state media has said there are
OL,14,Fsignificant casualties, while Nepalese
OL,15,Fofficials describe "huge scale loss".
OL,17,FBut rescuers are on edge because of the
OL,18,Frisk of further flooding. A lake of
OL,19,Frising water has formed at a site along
OL,20,Fthe border, and Chinese state media
OL,21,Fsays it is at "high risk" of bursting
OL,22,Fits banks.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
